{"id":"35b1019328310b86","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-rice.md","title":"Rice 定理","display":"thm-rice — Rice 定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-rice","aliases":["20-thm-rice"],"display":"thm-rice — Rice 定理","chapter":"1","section":"1.6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Corollary 1.6.14","source_pdf_pages":[52],"source_printed_pages":[16],"depends_on":["[[20-df-index-set]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-thm-index-set]]","[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-rice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-rice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rice — Rice 定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 1.6.14"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>52</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" href=\"?note=f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" title=\"20-df-index-set\">20-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c665d756a1e2160\" href=\"?note=3c665d756a1e2160\" title=\"20-thm-index-set\">20-thm-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal A}=\\{e:\\varphi_e\\in\\mathcal A\\}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal A}=\\{e:\\varphi_e\\in\\mathcal A\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 为可计算集合族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" href=\"?note=f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" title=\"20-df-index-set\">20-df-index-set</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3c665d756a1e2160\" href=\"?note=3c665d756a1e2160\" title=\"20-thm-index-set\">20-thm-index-set</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal A}\\in\\mathcal R\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\\lor\\mathcal A=\\mathcal C_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal A}\\in\\mathcal R\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\\lor\\mathcal A=\\mathcal C_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\\)</span> 或整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\mathcal C_1\\)</span>，其指标集合分别为空集或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，可计算。反向，若性质类非平凡，标准编号的满射性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 非平凡。相同部分函数要么均属于性质类、要么均不属于，故这是 IndexSet。</p>\n<p>索引集定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_1 I_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(K\\le_1 I_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_1\\overline{I_{\\mathcal A}}\">\\(K\\le_1\\overline{I_{\\mathcal A}}\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 可计算，其补集也可计算，且任一全可计算归约的逆像都可计算；两种情形都会使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 可计算，违反停机不可判定性。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 不可计算。直接依赖改为实际使用的 index-set 定理，避免把已有证明的关键一步只藏在“编译一个程序”的提示中。</p>\n<p>本结论针对部分函数的外延性质；程序长度或指标数值的语法性质未被套入 IndexSet。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 16 / PDF 52。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"f0ae2cb21680ca8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"3c665d756a1e2160","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"f0ae2cb21680ca8b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-index-set]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-index-set]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-index-set]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"3c665d756a1e2160","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-index-set]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-index-set]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal A}=\\{e:\\varphi_e\\in\\mathcal A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal A}\\in\\mathcal R\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\\lor\\mathcal A=\\mathcal C_1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\le_1 I_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\le_1\\overline{I_{\\mathcal A}}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal A}","display":false}],"bytes":1875,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f0ae2cb21680ca8b","d6dc5974baa6f8a5","dc642dd12c05d028","3c665d756a1e2160","d18ba716e49ac8c6"]}